<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Confirm Your New Email – Ocare Pharmacy</title>
</head>

<body
    style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f6f9; color:#333; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;">
    <div
        style="max-width:600px; margin:40px auto; background-color:#ffffff; padding:30px; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="text-align:center; padding-bottom:20px; border-bottom:2px solid #e6e9ef;">
            <h1 style="margin:0; font-size:26px; font-weight:700; color:#1ca24e;">
                Ocare Pharmacy
            </h1>
            <p style="margin:4px 0 0; color:#777; font-size:14px;">Email Change Request</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#333; padding-top:20px;">
            <p>Hi <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>,</p>

            <p>We received a request to change the email address associated with your <strong>Ocare Pharmacy</strong>
                account to <strong>{{newEmail}}</strong>.</p>

            <p>To confirm this change and verify your new email address, please click the button below:</p>

            <div style="margin:20px 0; text-align:center;">
                <a href="{{verificationLink}}"
                    style="display:inline-block; background:#1ca24e; color:#ffffff; padding:14px 32px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;">
                    Verify New Email
                </a>
            </div>

            <p>This verification link will expire in <strong>24 hours</strong>.</p>

            <p>If the button above doesn’t work, copy and paste the following link into your browser:</p>
            <p
                style="word-break:break-all; font-size:13px; color:#555; background:#f4f6f9; padding:10px; border-radius:4px;">
                {{verificationLink}}
            </p>

            <p>If you did not request this change, please ignore this email or contact our support team immediately at
                <a href="mailto:support@ocareug.com"
                    style="color:#1ca24e; text-decoration:none;">support@ocareug.com</a>.
            </p>

            <p>Your account security is important to us.</p>

            <p>Warm regards,<br /><strong>The Ocare Pharmacy Team</strong></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div
            style="margin-top:40px; font-size:12px; color:#777; text-align:center; border-top:1px solid #e6e9ef; padding-top:20px;">
            &copy; {{year}} Ocare Pharmacy · All rights reserved<br />
            <a href="https://ocareug.com" style="color:#1ca24e; text-decoration:none;">www.ocareug.com</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>